      "Ninu vimochinchi karuna kataakshamula nichchunu (2)",
      "Pakshiraaju yavvanamunu dayachesi",
      "Mellatho nee hrudayamu thrupthi parachunu",
      "Yesu naamamulone neeku rakshana",
